    steps: ["Set a realistic worship plan.", "Observe the fast from true dawn to sunset.", "Guard speech and conduct as well as food and drink.", "Use suhoor, prayers, and iftar as anchors.", "Increase Qur\u2019an, dua, charity, and service.", "Seek Laylatul Qadr in the final ten nights."],
