    short: "Hacc\u0131n kendisi olan vakfe",
    detail: "G\xFCne\u015F do\u011Fduktan sonra Arafat\u2019a gidin ve \xF6\u011Fleden ak\u015Fama kadar orada durun; \xF6\u011Fle ile ikindiyi birle\u015Ftirip k\u0131saltarak k\u0131l\u0131n. Arafat\u2019\u0131n tamam\u0131 vakfe yeridir, ancak halk Cebel\xFC\u2019r-Rahme\u2019deki kayan\u0131n yan\u0131nda toplan\u0131r. G\xFCn\xFC telbiye, zikir, Kur\u2019an, t\xF6vbe ve dua ile doldurun \u2014 hac bu g\xFCne dayan\u0131r."
